---
variables:
  - name: source
    required: true
  - name: num_sections
    required: true
role: compile.extract.agentic
response_format: json_object
---

Extract structured knowledge from the source "{{ source }}".
The source is divided into {{ num_sections }} sections.
Use get_section(section_id) to load a section's text, then
save_extraction(section_id, data) to record your extraction as JSON.

Process all sections in order. When done, reply "done".